<title>GERMANY: German inland gas oil steady amid average demand.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil steady amid average demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.7292)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     32.90/33.00     19.03/19.08   32.90/33.10</p>
<p> BREMEN		32.90/33.00     19.03/19.08   32.90/33.10</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    33.10/33.30     19.14/19.26   33.20/33.33</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   33.60/33.90     19.43/19.60   33.70/34.00</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   33.80/34.00     19.55/19.66   33.90/34.00</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  34.70/34.80     20.07/20.12   34.80/35.00</p>
<p>German inland gas oil was little changed on Monday. Traders said demand was average although there were signs that some players were holding back in the expectation that prices might fall further. -- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7714.</p>
</text>
